    "updated_at": "2023-11-11T21:51:31Z",
    "body": "I believe this needs to apply to not just HTMLVideoElement but to all video, including background video added via CSS. Please let me know whether that needs to be filed separately.\r\n\r\nI suggest the following wording replacement:\r\n\r\nIf the element or CSS URL consists of a video, the user has NOT requested the system to minimize motion.",
