    "body": "@ChasBelov, I assume you're referring to GIFs loaded with the `background-image` property, or are you talking about something else? If it's the latter, I assume since `background-image` is [defined in the CSS background spec](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-backgrounds/#background-image) that suggestion might instead belong in [the CSS repo](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts) instead. \r\n\r\nAs an aside, [this search in the CSS repo](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues?q=prefers-reduced-motion+GIF) brings up similar discussions regarding `prefers-reduced-motion` and CSS animation.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
