    "created_at": "2025-08-29T17:49:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-08-29T17:49:43Z",
    "body": "> from a site visitor's perspective, I don't care whether the video was added via HTML, CSS, or JavaScript for that matter; I don't want any video to auto-play.\n\n1000% this. I don't want media autoplaying at all.\n\nIn some very specific circumstances (like in-app notifications), I want audio to autoplay (and thankfully there is a permission prompt for that).\n\nBut absolutely never video. If others do, I suggest the same kind of permission prompt to autoplay video (but NOT coupled with audio autoplay permission).",
