    "created_at": "2025-09-01T14:01:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-01T14:01:32Z",
    "body": "There are lots of ways to do motion on the web and `<video>` is just one of them. If you block it for reasonable cases, then developers will just do it another way. E.g., they'll use `<canvas>` and the WebCodecs API, or something really bad like use a gif.",
